      "title": "Interactive Client Architecture",
      "items": [
        "Single-page vanilla ES modules: zero bundle bloat and instant load times",
        "240Hz Euler spring cursor physics: 6px diff-blended dot + 32px lens ring with sleep threshold",
        "Dual theming system: Obsidian Dark + Monochrome Brutalist Light with guaranteed WCAG AA >= 4.5:1",
